course: dictionary
lesson: 3079
title: Edition: one version of a book, paper or product
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: An edition is one version of something printed or made, like a book, a newspaper or a magazine. When a book is printed again with changes, the new printing is a new edition. The words around the word give you clues about which meaning fits.
explain: «The first edition of the book sold out in a week.» The clue is first: the earliest printed version of the book. «This week's edition» means one copy or issue of a newspaper that comes out regularly.
explain: «Limited edition» often means the same product in new packaging, made in small numbers. Limited is the clue: only a few are made, so it feels special. Check your meaning by putting it into the sentence and seeing if it still makes sense.
fact: An edition is one version of a book, newspaper, magazine or similar thing.
fact: A first edition is the very first printed version of a book.
fact: «Latest edition» means the newest version.
fact: «Limited edition» means a version made in small numbers or for a special reason.
fact: Minecraft was first written in Java, and the Bedrock edition is written in C++: the same game can come in different editions.
exercise: «The first edition of the book sold out in a week.» What does edition mean here? | *One printed version of the book | A page with a picture | A writer who makes up stories | A kind of bookshelf
exercise: «Limited edition» often means what? | *The same product in new packaging, made in small numbers | A product that is free to everyone | A very long book | A product that never changes
exercise: Find and copy the word that means one issue of a newspaper: «Read this week's edition of the newspaper.» | newspaper | this | *edition | week's
test: «Minecraft was first written in Java; the Bedrock edition is written in C++.» What does edition mean here? | *A different version of the same game | A player in the game | A kind of programming language for websites | A page in a book
test: Which phrase means the newest version of a book? | Old picture | Limited edition | *Latest edition | Special cake
exam: Which best explains «special edition»? | *A version made for a special reason, often in small numbers | A toy that is always free | A very old toy | A toy that can talk
